Package: tailcdf
Title: Tail Extrapolation from Truncated Cumulative Event Curves
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Vladimir",
           family = "Iakovlev",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "iakovlev.v@gmail.com")
Description: Fits parametric distributions to right-truncated event times using maximum likelihood estimation. Estimates the eventual total number of events, observed completeness, empirical likelihood-envelope bounds, and times to reach specified percentages of the eventual total.
